+### Including multiple mapping configurations
+
+Multiple `IncludeMappingConfigurationAttribute`s can be applied to the same mapping method,
+for example to reuse configurations defined for different interfaces implemented by the source and target types:
+
+```csharp
+[MapProperty(nameof(IAudit.CreatedBy), nameof(IAuditDto.CreatedByUser))]
+public static partial void MapAudit(IAudit audit, IAuditDto auditDto);
+
+[MapProperty(nameof(IOwnable.Owner), nameof(IOwnableDto.OwnerName))]
+public static partial void MapOwnable(IOwnable ownable, IOwnableDto ownableDto);
+
+// highlight-start
+[IncludeMappingConfiguration(nameof(MapAudit))]
+[IncludeMappingConfiguration(nameof(MapOwnable))]
+// highlight-end
+public static partial HouseDto ToDto(House house);
+```
+
